rigol-scope-kit

Selected interface, MCP organization, and Skill packaging patterns are adapted
from scopebench-mcp 0.3.1 by scopebench-mcp contributors, distributed under
Apache License 2.0. Source: https://pypi.org/project/scopebench-mcp/0.3.1/

Modifications: MHO900 SCPI driver; strict bounded TCP framing; shared device
locking and pinned identity; channel, trigger and dual AFG controls; waveform
capture/export and artifact delivery; offline analysis/timing; versioned
profiles and contracts; short-lived prepared capture ownership; explicit
wake/release; CLI/MCP, Chinese Agent Skill, uv packaging and documentation.
This project is not affiliated with RIGOL. Manufacturer manuals are not included.
